   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,824:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Descripción General
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,836:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Este proyecto implementa un motor de procesamiento de eventos en tiempo real completamente funcional con
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,838:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: capacidades de procesamiento distribuido, tolerancia a fallos y agregaciones con ventanas temporales.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,839:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Características Principales
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,840:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,848:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Procesamiento Distribuido
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,855:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Arquitectura master-worker con balanceo de carga automático
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,858:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: mediante algoritmo round-robin consciente de capacidad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,859:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,861:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tolerancia a Fallos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,864:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Detección de fallos mediante heartbeats y re-planificación automática de
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,865:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: topologías
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,866:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,867:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ventanas Temporales
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,869:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Soporte para ventanas tumbling y sliding con agregaciones (count, sum,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,870:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: average)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,871:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,873:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Checkpointing
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,874:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Persistencia periódica del estado de ventanas para auditoría y recuperación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,875:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,877:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Observabilidad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Métricas en tiempo real de CPU, memoria, throughput y backlog por worker
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,880:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,881:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Persistencia
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,882:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Estado del master persiste en 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,890:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: state/master_state.json
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,894:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  para recuperación tras
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,896:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: reinicios
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,898:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Casos de Uso
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,899:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,901:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Análisis de logs en tiempo real con agregaciones por ventanas temporales
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,902:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,904:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Procesamiento de métricas de aplicaciones distribuidas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,905:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,907:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pipelines ETL con transformaciones y filtrado de eventos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,910:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Análisis de eventos con particionado por clave (key-by)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Arquitectura del Sistema
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:16,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Diagrama de Componentes
