   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,031:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Flujo de Procesamiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,032:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,034:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Registro de Workers
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,039:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Los workers se registran con el master al iniciar, declarando su capacidad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,040:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: (slots) y URL de API
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,042:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,043:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Envío de Topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,045:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : El cliente envía una definición de topología (JSON) al master
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,046:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,047:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Planificación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,049:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : El master selecciona un worker apropiado usando round-robin con conciencia de carga
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,050:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,051:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Despliegue
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,053:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : El master envía la topología al worker seleccionado, que crea el pipeline de operadores
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,054:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,056:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ingesta
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,058:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Los eventos enviados al master son enrutados al worker que posee la topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,059:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  6 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,060:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Procesamiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,062:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : El worker procesa eventos a través de la cadena de operadores configurada
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,063:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  7 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,064:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Checkpointing
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,066:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Los operadores con estado persisten snapshots periódicos a disco
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,067:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  8 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,069:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Monitoreo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,071:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Heartbeats cada 2 segundos actualizan métricas de salud y rendimiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,072:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Protocolos de Comunicación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,074:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: API Pública del Master (puerto 8080)
