   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,147:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,148:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /api/v1/metrics
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,150:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                | GET    | Métricas globales del sistema    |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,152:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: API Interna de Workers (puerto 9001+)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Endpoint               | Método | Descripción                           |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | ---------------------- | ------ |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ------------------------------------- |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,160:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,161:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /internal/topologies
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,163:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | POST   | Recibir despliegue de topología       |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,165:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,166:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /internal/ingest
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,167:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:      | POST   | Recibir lote de eventos para procesar |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,168:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,169:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,170:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /internal/teardown
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,175:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:    | POST   |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,176:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Detener y limpiar topología           |
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,178:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Componentes Principales
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,180:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1. Master (Coordinador)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,181:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Archivo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,183:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,184:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: master/src/main.rs
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,185:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Responsabilidades
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,186:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,187:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,190:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Mantener el registro de workers activos con información de salud y capacidad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,191:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,193:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Persistir estado de topologías en 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,194:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: state/master_state.json
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,195:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,197:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Implementar algoritmo de planificación round-robin con conciencia de carga:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,198:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,200:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Prioriza workers con slots disponibles (
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,201:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: active_topologies < slots
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,202:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,203:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,205:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ordena candidatos por ratio de carga (
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,206:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: active/slots
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,207:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,209:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,210:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Fallback a round-robin simple cuando todos están saturados
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,211:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,213:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Monitorear heartbeats y marcar workers como 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,214:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DOWN
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,216:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  tras 6 segundos sin respuesta
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,217:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,219:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Re-planificar topologías automáticamente cuando un worker falla
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,220:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,222:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Enrutar eventos de ingesta al worker apropiado
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,223:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Estructuras de Datos Clave
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,225:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,226:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct AppState {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,228:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     workers: RwLock<HashMap<String, WorkerRecord>>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,229:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     topologies: RwLock<HashMap<Uuid, TopologyRecord>>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,231:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     rr_cursor: Mutex<usize>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,233:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     state_path: PathBuf,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,235:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,237:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct WorkerRecord {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,238:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     worker_id: String,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,240:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     api_url: String,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,241:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     slots: usize,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,243:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     last_heartbeat: Instant,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,244:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     metrics: WorkerMetrics,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,246:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     topologies: HashSet<Uuid>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,247:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     is_down: bool,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,248:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,251:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct TopologyRecord {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,253:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     spec: TopologySpec,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,256:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     status: TopologyStatusKind, // Accepted, Running, Canceled,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,258:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Failed
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,259:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     worker_id: Option<String>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,261:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     metrics: TopologyMetrics,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,263:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     attempt: u32,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,275:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     last_error: Option<String>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,277:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,278:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tolerancia a Fallos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,280:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,282:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El master ejecuta un watchdog que cada 3 segundos:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,283:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,284:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Identifica workers sin heartbeat por más de 6 segundos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,285:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,286:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Marca el worker como 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,287:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DOWN
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,288:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,290:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Recupera todas las topologías asignadas al worker caído
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,291:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,293:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Re-planifica cada topología en un worker disponible
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,294:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,295:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Incrementa el contador de intentos (
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,296:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: attempt
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,297:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,298:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2. Worker (Ejecutor)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,300:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Archivo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,301:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,302:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: worker/src/main.rs
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,303:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Responsabilidades
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,304:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,305:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,307:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Registrarse con el master al iniciar, usando 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,309:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: --advertise-url
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,310:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  si bind es 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,311:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 0.0.0.0
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,312:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,314:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Exponer API interna para recibir despliegues y eventos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,315:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,316:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Crear y gestionar instancias de 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,317:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PipelineEngine
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,318:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  por topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,320:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,321:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Enviar heartbeats cada 2 segundos con métricas actualizadas:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,322:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,324:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CPU usage (porcentaje promedio de todos los cores)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,325:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,326:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Memoria utilizada (bytes)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,327:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,328:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Número de topologías activas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,329:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,331:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Profundidad de cola (eventos pendientes)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,332:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,333:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Throughput (eventos por segundo)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,335:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,336:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gestionar canales asíncronos para procesamiento de eventos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,338:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Estructuras de Datos Clave
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,339:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,340:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct WorkerState {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,342:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     worker_id: String,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,343:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     master_url: String,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,344:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     slots: usize,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,345:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     state_dir: PathBuf,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,347:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     topologies: Arc<RwLock<HashMap<Uuid, TopologyRuntime>>>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,349:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     system: Arc<Mutex<System>>, // sysinfo para métricas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,350:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,352:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct TopologyRuntime {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,353:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     spec: TopologySpec,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,354:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     tx: mpsc::Sender<StreamingEvent>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,356:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     pending: Arc<AtomicUsize>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,357:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     processed: Arc<AtomicU64>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,359:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     attempt: u32,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,360:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,361:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pipeline de Procesamiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,363:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,364:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cada topología ejecuta en una tarea Tokio independiente:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,366:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: async fn run_pipeline(
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,367:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     mut engine: PipelineEngine,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,369:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     mut rx: mpsc::Receiver<StreamingEvent>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,371:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     pending: Arc<AtomicUsize>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     processed: Arc<AtomicU64>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,382:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     while let Some(event) = rx.recv().await {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,385:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         engine.process(event).await;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,386:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         pending.fetch_sub(1, Ordering::SeqCst);
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,387:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         processed.fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst);
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,388:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,389:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     engine.shutdown().await; // Flush windows
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,390:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,391:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3. Pipeline Engine
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,392:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Archivo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,396:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: worker/src/pipeline.rs
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,397:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Responsabilidades
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,398:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,399:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,401:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Construir cadena de operadores desde especificación JSON
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,402:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,403:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Procesar eventos secuencialmente a través de operadores
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,404:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,406:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gestionar fan-out cuando operadores generan múltiples eventos (flat
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,407:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: _
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,408:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: map)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,409:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,410:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Coordinar checkpointing de operadores con estado
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,411:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,413:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Restaurar estado desde checkpoints al inicializar
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,414:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Operadores Implementados
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,415:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,416:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: enum OperatorNode {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,418:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Map(MapOperator),           // Transformaciones string
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Filter(FilterOperator),     // Predicados de filtrado
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,421:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     FlatMap(FlatMapOperator),   // Expansión de arrays/strings
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,423:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Key(KeyByOperator),         // Asignación de claves
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Window(WindowOperator),     // Ventanas temporales + agregación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,426:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Sink(SinkOperator),         // Salida final (logging)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,427:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,429:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Procesamiento de Eventos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,430:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,432:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: pub async fn process(&mut self, event: StreamingEvent) ->
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,433:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Result<()> {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,435:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     let mut batch = vec![event];
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,436:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     for operator in &mut self.operators {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,438:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         let mut next_batch = Vec::new();
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,439:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         for ev in batch {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,441:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:             operator.apply(ev, &mut next_batch).await?;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,442:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         batch = next_batch;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,445:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         if batch.is_empty() { break; }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,447:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     Ok(())
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,450:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4. Window Operator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Archivo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: worker/src/pipeline.rs
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (struct 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: WindowOperator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Funcionalidad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Asignación de eventos a ventanas temporales basadas en timestamp
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,473:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,475:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Soporte para ventanas tumbling (sin overlap) y sliding (con overlap)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,476:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Agregaciones: 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,478:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: count
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,480:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,481:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sum
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,482:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,483:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: average
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,484:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,485:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Checkpointing configurable (por defecto cada 5 segundos)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,486:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,487:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Carga automática del checkpoint más reciente al desplegar topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Algoritmo de Ventanas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: let ts_ms = event.timestamp.timestamp_millis();
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: let length = spec.window.length_ms as i64;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,494:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: let slide = spec.window.slide_ms.unwrap_or(length) as i64;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,495:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: // Calcular inicio de ventana
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,496:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: let start = (ts_ms / slide) * slide;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: let end = start + length;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,499:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: // Actualizar estado de ventana
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,500:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: windows.entry((key, start))
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,501:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     .or_insert(WindowState::new(key, start, end))
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,503:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     .update(aggregator, value_field, event)?;
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,504:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: // Emitir ventanas expiradas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,505:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: for (key, state) in windows.iter() {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,506:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     if ts_ms >= state.end_ms {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,508:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         output.push(state.into_event());
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,509:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         expired_keys.push(key);
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,510:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,511:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Formato de Checkpoint
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,514:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: [
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,517:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "key": "service-api",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,519:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "window_start": 1638316800000,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "window_end": 1638316860000,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,521:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "count": 42,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,522:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "sum": 1250.75
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,523:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,524:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ]
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,526:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ubicación: 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,528:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: state/<topology_id>/attempt-<N>/<operator_id>/checkpoint-<timestamp>.json
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,529:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5. Client (CLI)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,531:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Archivo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,533:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,534:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client/src/main.rs
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,535:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Comandos Disponibles
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,537:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,538:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Enviar topología desde archivo JSON
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,540:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client submit-topology <path/to/topology.json>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,541:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Consultar estado de topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,542:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client status <topology-id>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,544:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Cancelar topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,545:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client cancel-topology <topology-id>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,547:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Inyectar eventos desde archivo JSONL o stdin
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,548:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client ingest <topology-id> --file <path/to/events.jsonl>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,550:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: client ingest <topology-id> < events.jsonl
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,560:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Formato de Eventos (JSONL)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,562:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,566:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {"timestamp": "2024-12-03T10:00:00Z", "service": "api", "level":
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,568:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "INFO", "message": "Request processed"}
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,571:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {"timestamp": "2024-12-03T10:00:01Z", "service": "db", "level":
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,572:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "ERROR", "message": "Connection timeout"}
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,573:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El campo 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,574:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: timestamp
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,575:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  o 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,577:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ts
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,579:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  es obligatorio y debe estar en formato RFC3339.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,581:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Características Implementadas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,583:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Persistencia del Master
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,584:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El master guarda su estado completo en 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: state/master_state.json
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  después de cada operación crítica:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,588:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,590:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Submit de nueva topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,591:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,593:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cambio de estado de topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,594:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,595:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ingesta de eventos (actualización de métricas)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,596:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,597:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cancelación de topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,599:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Al reiniciar, el master recarga automáticamente todas las topologías persistidas. Las topologías en estado 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,601:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Running
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,604:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,605:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: requerirán re-planificación cuando los workers se reconecten.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,607:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Métricas en Tiempo Real
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,609:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Worker Metrics
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,610:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (enviadas cada 2s via heartbeat):
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,612:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct WorkerMetrics {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,613:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     cpu_pct: f64,              // % CPU promedio
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,615:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     mem_bytes: u64,            // Memoria usada en bytes
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,617:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     active_topologies: usize,  // Número de topologías activas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,619:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     queue_depth: usize,        // Eventos pendientes en colas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,620:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     throughput_eps: f64,       // Eventos procesados por segundo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,621:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,623:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Topology Metrics
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,624:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,625:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: struct TopologyMetrics {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,627:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     events_ingested: u64,           // Total eventos recibidos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,629:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     events_emitted: u64,            // Total eventos emitidos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,630:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     last_checkpoint: Option<DateTime<Utc>>,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,632:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,633:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Endpoint de Métricas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,634:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,636:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/metrics
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,637:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Respuesta:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,638:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,640:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "workers": [
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,641:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,642:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "worker_id": "worker-1",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,644:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "is_down": false,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,653:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "metrics": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,655:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "cpu_pct": 15.3,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,656:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "mem_bytes": 52428800,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,657:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "active_topologies": 2,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,658:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "queue_depth": 150,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,659:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "throughput_eps": 3450.5
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,660:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       },
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,661:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "topologies": ["uuid1", "uuid2"]
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,662:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,662:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   ],
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,663:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "topologies": [
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,664:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,665:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "topology_id": "uuid1",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,666:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "name": "log-processor",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,667:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "status": "Running",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,668:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "worker_id": "worker-1",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,669:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "metrics": { ... },
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,670:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "attempt": 0
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,671:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,672:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   ]
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,672:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,673:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Checkpointing y Recuperación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,675:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configuración en Topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,677:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,678:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,679:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "id": "window-op",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,681:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "kind": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,682:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "window_aggregate": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,683:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "window": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,684:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "length_ms": 60000,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,686:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "slide_ms": 30000,
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,687:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "checkpoint_interval_ms": 5000
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,688:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       },
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,689:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "aggregator": "average",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,691:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "key_field": "service",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,694:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "value_field": "response_time"
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,695:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,696:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,697:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,698:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Comportamiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,699:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,701:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,702:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cada 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,704:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: checkpoint_interval_ms
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,707:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , el operador serializa todas las ventanas activas a JSON
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,708:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,710:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Los checkpoints se guardan en disco con timestamp monotónico
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,712:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,714:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Al desplegar una topología, el worker busca el checkpoint más reciente
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,715:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,716:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Las ventanas se reconstruyen con 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,718:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: count
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,719:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  y 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,720:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sum
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,721:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  preservados
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,722:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,724:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Los checkpoints sirven para auditoría y recuperación manual
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,725:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gestión de Topologías
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,727:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Listar Todas las Topologías
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,728:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,739:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/topologies
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,741:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cancelar Topología
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,742:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,745:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/topologies/<id>/cancel
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Al cancelar:
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,747:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El estado cambia a 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,748:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Canceled
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,749:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,750:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Se envía mensaje de teardown al worker
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,751:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,753:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El worker detiene el pipeline y libera recursos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,754:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,755:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: El estado persiste en disco
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,756:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Operadores Soportados
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,758:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Map Operator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,759:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Transforma valores de campos string.
