   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,796:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Filter Operator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,798:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Filtra eventos según predicados sobre campos.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,799:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configuración
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,800:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,802:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,803:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "id": "filter-errors",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,805:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "kind": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,808:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "filter": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,811:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "field": "level",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,814:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "predicate": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,817:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:         "equals": { "value": "ERROR" }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,819:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,823:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,842:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,844:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,845:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Predicados Disponibles
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,847:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,849:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,850:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: exists
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,852:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Campo existe (valor no null)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,853:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,855:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: equals
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,856:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Igualdad exacta
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,857:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,858:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: not_equals
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,859:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Desigualdad
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,860:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,861:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: greater_than
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,862:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Mayor que (numérico)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,862:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,865:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: less_than
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,866:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Menor que (numérico)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,868:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,870:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: contains
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,871:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Substring (string)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,872:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: FlatMap Operator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,875:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Expande arrays o strings delimitados en múltiples eventos.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,876:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configuración
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,877:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,880:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "id": "split-tags",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,881:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "kind": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,883:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "flat_map": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,885:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "field": "tags",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "separator": ","
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,889:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,890:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Comportamiento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,891:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,892:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,894:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Si el campo es un array JSON: genera un evento por elemento
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,895:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,897:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Si el campo es string con separador: split y genera un evento por parte
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,898:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,900:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cada evento clonado contiene todos los campos originales excepto el campo expandido
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,902:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: KeyBy Operator
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,904:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Asigna clave de particionado para operadores downstream.
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,905:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configuración
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,906:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,907:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "id": "key-by-service",
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,909:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   "kind": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,911:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     "key_by": {
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:       "field": "service"
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,915:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:   }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,916:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: }
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,917:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Efecto
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,918:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Establece 
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,920:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: event.key
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,921:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  usado por window aggregations para agrupar eventos.
