   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,964:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,966:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: checkpoint_interval_ms
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:17,967:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Frecuencia de persistencia
