   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,021:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Guía de Inicio Rápido
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,022:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Requisitos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,024:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,025:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Rust 1.78 o superior
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,036:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,037:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Make (opcional, para comandos simplificados)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,039:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,040:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Docker y Docker Compose (opcional, para despliegue containerizado)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,042:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Compilación
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,043:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Clonar repositorio
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,045:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: git clone <repository-url>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,046:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cd streaming-engine
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,047:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Compilar workspace completo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,049:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: cargo build --workspace --release
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,050:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # O usando Make
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,051:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make build-release
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,053:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ejecución Local
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,054:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Opción 1: Usando Make
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,056:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Terminal 1: Iniciar master
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,057:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make run-master
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,058:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Terminal 2: Iniciar primer worker
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,059:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make run-worker
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,061:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Terminal 3: Iniciar segundo worker (opcional)
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,062:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make run-worker-2
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,063:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Terminal 4: Enviar topología ejemplo
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,065:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make submit TOPOLOGY=docs/examples/log_topology.json
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,066:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Inyectar eventos
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,068:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make ingest TOPOLOGY_ID=<id-from-submit>
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,069:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: FILE=docs/examples/logs.jsonl
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,070:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Ver métricas
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,071:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make metrics
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,072:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: # Consultar estado
   DEBUG: 2025-12-03 21:00:18,073:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: make status TOPOLOGY_ID=<id>
